Marisol Vega: Sorry about the room shuffle—glad we found each other. The April observation slots are getting tight, so today I’d like us to settle on a participation outcome we can actually code in both the garden and park groups, without losing sight of what teachers notice about the quieter kids. Did you get a chance to look back at the pilot field notes?

